  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of Effective Water Resources Management System and Enhancement of Disaster Response Capabilities for  Nam Ngum River Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the capacity of flood resilience for residence and provide efficient water management in NamNgum River Basin through water management system&#xb0a8;&#xb2a5;&#xac15; &#xc720;&#xc5ed;(&#xb2e8;&#xc704;) &#xd1b5;&#xd569;&#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; (IWRM) &#xc774;&#xd589;&#xb3c4; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;, &#xb0a8;&#xb2a5;&#xac15; &#xc720;&#xc5ed; &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0; &#xc815;&#xbcf4;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xbc0f; &#xd6a8;&#xc728;&#xc801; &#xbb3c;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xac15;&#xd654;, &#xb0a8;&#xb2a5;&#xac15; &#xc720;&#xc5ed; &#xb310; &#xc548;&#xc804; &#xbc0f; &#xc7ac;&#xb09c; &#xb300;&#xc751;&#xb2a5;&#xb825; &#xac15;&#xd654;, &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0;&#xc815;&#xbcf4;&#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xc6b4;&#xc601; &#xbc0f; &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0;&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xc5c5;&#xbb34; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of IWRM implementation in the Nam Ngum river basin, Enhancement of the water resources information system in in the Nam Ngum river basin, Strengthening the capacities for safety and disaster response of dams in the Nam Ngum river basin, Enhancement the capacity of water agencies to operate water information system and water management</narrative>
  </description>
